{"product":{"id":9728668664033,"title":"JEFFREY 92","body_html":"<p>The Jeffrey 92 is our progressive all-mountain twin: a 92mm ski built for speed and wired for control on hardpack.</p>\n<p>The foundation of our narrowest Jeffrey is Ripper Rocker: 25% more camber, 10% more contact length, and 15% lower tip and tail rocker than our Signature Rocker to tighten grip and add pop in firm conditions. For 26/27, an updated Bi-Radius Sidecut boosts edge hold and a new flex profile adds torsional stiffness for a more capable hardpack ski. Delta Taper keeps the tails easy to pivot in tight terrain and moguls. This is the Jeffrey for skiers on firm snow who want precision without losing the twin tip feel. It’s a bad day to be corduroy.</p>\n<p>Every Jeffrey 92 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon, our proprietary composite weave that improves strength and durability while decreasing weight. Pair that with our trademark 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing, and you have one of the most durable and capable freestyle skis on the mountain.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:23-07:00","handle":"jeffrey-92","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:32-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Jeffrey, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128507703521,"product_id":9728668664033,"title":"171cm / Onyx","price":"899.00","sku":"27ON3PJF92171","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"171cm","option2":"Onyx","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:23-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":0,"old_inventory_quantity":0,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD